endment 3</a><a href="/student-loan-wage-garnishment-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Student Loan Garnishment</a><a href="/tax-bracket-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Tax Bracket</a><a href="/debt-to-income-ratio-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Debt-to-Income Ratio</a><a href="/social-security-taxable-benefits-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Taxable Social Security</a><a href="/checklists/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Checklists</a><a href="/charitable-donation-tax-deduction-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Charitable Donation Deduction</a><a href="/salary-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Salary</a><a href="/car-loan-interest-deduction-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Car Loan Interest Deduction</a><a href="/paycheck-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Paycheck</a><a href="/rent-vs-buy-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Rent vs Buy</a><a href="/stock-capital-gains-tax-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Stock Capital Gains Tax</a><a href="/hidden-cost-of-owning-a-home-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Hidden Cost of Owning a Home</a><a href="/backdoor-roth-pro-rata-calculator/" role="menuitem" class="" data-astro-cid-ctg3m53h>Backdoor Roth Pro Rata</a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ns" data-api-base="https://growth-sites-api.onrender.com" data-astro-cid-x4l6pap7> <button class="ns__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ns-panel" aria-label="Search" data-astro-cid-x4l6pap7> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-x4l6pap7> <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" data-astro-cid-x4l6pap7></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5" data-astro-c